{'symbol': 'HCA', 'date': '2022-08-17 08:30:00', 'title': 'HCA HEALTHCARE ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT OF LONGTIME SENIOR EXECUTIVE CHUCK HALL', 'text': "NASHVILLE, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HCA HEALTHCARE, INC. (NYSE: HCA), ONE OF THE NATION'S LEADING HEALTHCARE PROVIDERS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHUCK HALL, HCA HEALTHCARE'S NATIONAL GROUP PRESIDENT, WILL RETIRE AT THE END OF THE YEAR AFTER NEARLY 36 YEARS WITH THE ORGANIZATION. CURRENTLY, HALL IS RESPONSIBLE FOR HCA HEALTHCARE'S OPERATIONS AT 96 HOSPITALS ACROSS 13 STATES. OVER MORE THAN THREE DECADES, HALL HAS BEEN INFLUENTIAL IN MANY SUCCESSFUL INITIATIVES THAT WILL BENEFIT THE COMPANY FOR YEARS"}